                        <p>
                            The Fred Meijer Center for Writing provides writing
                            assistance to all GVSU students, on any type of
                            project and at any stage of the process.
                            The Writing Center employs both undergraduate and
                            graduate writing consultants from a variety of
                            majors and disciplines.
                            Consultants are trained to help writers brainstorm,
                            organize, and/or develop their ideas, and they can
                            help writers edit their own work and document
                            sources correctly.
                            The Center's services are free and students can work
                            with an idea or assignment prompt all the way
                            through drafting and finalizing their paper.
                            We look forward to working with you!
